               <p xml:id="idm100">In 1809 a monument for the slain in the naval battle against the English at Sjællands Odde in 1808 was erected. The monument consists of a four metre high sandstone column, crowned with a naval officer's helmet in marble. On the base is a plate with the poems by N.F.S. Grundtvig to which Hartmann set music.</p>
